{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_151_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_151_1000_003mik", "source_sha256": "2c98cba01060347b26e83a200616eb95e7af3dd9b9fe8553aee9e680cab4fe2b", "ja": "あれ、のり子はヤなの？　ファッションショー。\nヤなら断ってもいいと思うな。", "zh": "咦，法子不想去吗？时装秀。\n要是讨厌的话，美希觉得拒绝掉也没关系哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_151_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_151_1001_043nor", "source_sha256": "f50180499eb0d5dc85b0a02640735474c31ab93fc60bbdad60f59fd637e148ce", "ja": "あ、ううん！\n嫌とかそういうんじゃないんだけどさ。", "zh": "啊，不，不是的！\n也不是讨厌之类的，只是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_151_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_151_1002_007ior", "source_sha256": "f6d7d94d3c24ffa2b87a8fddcb295e44c12a61a5c2d69434251470daf4c30f8e", "ja": "じゃあ何よ？　そんなため息なんてついちゃって。\nらしくないじゃない。", "zh": "那到底是为什么？干嘛叹这么大一口气。\n这可不像你啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_151_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_151_1003_043nor", "source_sha256": "d8c449ba1c73de130e154146db47298bd9b733c2b540f354a8dd9e3a16cdfb74", "ja": "だ、だって、JCCってすごい注目されてるじゃない？\nホントにアタシでいいのかなって。", "zh": "可、可是，JCC不是备受瞩目吗？\n我真的可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_151_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_151_1004_007ior", "source_sha256": "c88dfeeb813528a84f5b47a5ce23597c6bb7aa83392f7c5bc97f5cb9c47b576f", "ja": "ダメならそもそも出演メンバーに選ばれてないでしょ。\nのり子って、ヘンなところで引っ込み思案なのね。", "zh": "如果不行的话，根本就不会被选为出演成员吧。\n没想到你会在这种奇怪的地方害羞呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_151_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_151_1005_043nor", "source_sha256": "05639ccc9fe123eb4f9a917fb565b06c08fdf0249a8f08fd82d68271b9318575", "ja": "うぐっ。\nそう、なんだよね～……はぁ。", "zh": "呃。\n是啊，确实是这么回事呢～……唉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_151_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_151_1006_se", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_151_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_151_1007_p", "source_sha256": "cffccf0c779b90a5db7c2fd9b11138e3c7e2020e5c637225b1b25656d8ab99e6", "ja": "お、3人とも先に来てたんだな。\nお疲れさま。", "zh": "哦，你们3人都先到了啊。辛苦了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_151_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_151_1008_029umi", "source_sha256": "36e6f940c876fc7e6cfdbc152c85083ce494e6ae401a05d41eb820c996216073", "ja": "みんな、お疲れさまーっ☆　……って、あれ？\nのりさんどうしたの？　ホントにお疲れ？", "zh": "大家辛苦啦——☆……咦？\n诺莉姐，你怎么了？真的累了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_151_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_151_1009_032emi", "source_sha256": "16d608d7306a55c578f6a79f67b39a34f08db2c3b8183c631fd6765d93cef2d6", "ja": "お疲れでしたら、\n無理はなさらないほうが……。", "zh": "如果您累了，还是不要勉强自己……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_151_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_151_1010_043nor", "source_sha256": "9dfc44cb0962ee30bb08a9012b3201b11a0981acee5d7844588d2a1c7163a26f", "ja": "あ、ううん、大丈夫！\nアタシはいつも通り元気だよ。元気元気！　あはは…。", "zh": "啊，不，没事！\n我和平时一样精神着呢。精神满满！啊哈哈……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_151_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_151_1011_p", "source_sha256": "2d5be20d2819e5e62b652147afa1d46e28602dde4ad30b0790f07c6b7e663dca", "ja": "疲れてはないかもしれないけど、なんだか\n浮かない顔はしてるな。何かあったのか？", "zh": "虽然可能并不累，但总觉得你一副闷闷不乐的样子。是发生什么事了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_151_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_151_1012_003mik", "source_sha256": "d302b73d6817c11ccaacb322b3e4094e6d339037633a4537b02a1a3bd4d3727c", "ja": "あのね、のり子がね、JCCに出るのイヤかもって。", "zh": "那个，纪子她好像不太想参加JCC。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_151_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_151_1013_043nor", "source_sha256": "3b23c52d7bd3e2ff011b0b2ee5ab062b4d5759713a7f14d35d8d31a591ef85ef", "ja": "ああっ！？　ちょ、ちょっと、美希！", "zh": "啊！？等、等一下，美希！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_151_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_151_1014_p", "source_sha256": "75ed1730e756f560caaac9cd62a487298aaa1f36b3e95e432bf278ed4b0fc14d", "ja": "それは聞き捨てならないな……。\n詳しく聞かせてくれるか？", "zh": "这可不能当作没听见……  \n能详细说说吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_151_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_151_1016_p", "source_sha256": "1ca28c4fec5262a475dc77839bb171fce97026db9f7fb2636cd54b5bc3c006ac", "ja": "なるほど。のり子がどうしても嫌なら、\n無理にとは言わないけど……。", "zh": "原来如此。如果纪子实在不愿意的话，我也不会勉强她……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_151_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_151_1017_043nor", "source_sha256": "7c2867f1e6eb046a58d8e32eb29bc1b217456f6c9ee1cd88da90edb0b725534a", "ja": "だから嫌とかじゃないんだって！　\n選んでくれたのはすっごく嬉しいよ！　ホントに！", "zh": "所以我都说了，不是不喜欢啊！  \n能被你选中，我真的特别开心！真的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_151_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_151_1018_p", "source_sha256": "ba1fc38dfe148c3498aaa59cf18206f0437d64c6f7f36318aee2d86e6832288d", "ja": "そうか。\n嫌じゃないなら、ひとまずはよかったよ。", "zh": "这样啊。\n既然不是讨厌，那暂时就放心了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_151_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_151_1019_043nor", "source_sha256": "69b7b1bfe1cd95c092e0ee7085f9d46229aa5505840f13122ea7a9e7106a7cc7", "ja": "うん……。でもJCCってほら、華やかでキラキラで、\nまさに女の子たちの憧れ！　っていうか……。", "zh": "嗯……可是你想想，JCC既华丽又闪闪发光，\n可以说是完全符合女孩子们向往的形象！该说是这样呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_151_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_151_1020_043nor", "source_sha256": "75dec370680aef4e271e85ed7295704c82412553f57938e1ae7a0f38ffe2d4d6", "ja": "その、カワイイ服とかたくさん着るんでしょ？\n正直……アタシの柄じゃないんじゃないかなって！", "zh": "那个，会穿很多可爱的衣服吧？\n说实话……我觉得那不太像我的风格！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_151_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_151_1021_007ior", "source_sha256": "71a039461e84efddd47ee9d02b9ed95344775cae958fa4eb2529181cd0b87788", "ja": "カワイイ衣装なんて、もう山ほど着てるじゃない。\n今さらなに怖気づいてるわけ？", "zh": "你不是已经穿过一大堆可爱的服装了吗？\n事到如今还在害怕什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_151_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_151_1022_043nor", "source_sha256": "a6bdf0258ec64aaaf98a4671e1ff08db2cc6581b5c9deac54c02720d8662684f", "ja": "ううっ……今さら、だよね。それはそう……。", "zh": "呜呜……事到如今了，对吧。话是这么说啦……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_151_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_151_1023_029umi", "source_sha256": "2e892ec8438d47018943931050c17b6d40d9dc6a99d0d33400f80b3f1c2f34aa", "ja": "私は、普段着れない服が着れるの楽しみだけどな～！\nカワイイ服で女子力アップできそうだし☆", "zh": "我倒是很期待能穿上平时穿不了的衣服呢～！感觉穿上可爱的衣服，女孩子的魅力也会提升呢☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_151_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_151_1024_032emi", "source_sha256": "67c8dfb007334e32f2bb8c2658fee8bd9ecd0cb0691206404c06cec0ec4c3cce", "ja": "私は、わかるような気がします。\nとても華やかな舞台ですから……。", "zh": "我好像有些明白了。因为那是一个非常华丽的舞台……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_151_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_151_1025_032emi", "source_sha256": "bd89f61ab0cedccecb7db0e80e599ed3fdb429a8cadeb4008f2c708694537f52", "ja": "自分がこの場に相応しいのかと考えると、\nつい気おくれしてしまって……。", "zh": "一想到自己是否适合这个场合，就不由得有些畏缩……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_151_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_151_1026_043nor", "source_sha256": "9d5486f8c584e7dfe0f61d0dbc1309c3b2ac8f2568414d1bd6543c4ce9722f6f", "ja": "いや、エミリーはピッタリだから大丈夫！\nなんならJCCの王座も狙える可愛さだし！！", "zh": "不，艾米莉非常合适，放心吧！真要说的话，她的可爱甚至能冲击JCC的王座！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_151_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_151_1027_032emi", "source_sha256": "3a22a3b8e42fe6aa4f9cb3acd22443e987158888f3fa1e74c3526a1ff4db15f1", "ja": "そ、そうでしょうか……？", "zh": "是、是这样吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_151_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_151_1028_007ior", "source_sha256": "cea1872dbfa5ca0848925e2c048ae50a85e4e16e1adc398acf1916ee3a5dd740", "ja": "なんかこういうの、誰かさんを思い出すわね。", "zh": "这种感觉，总让我想起某个人呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_151_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_151_1029_003mik", "source_sha256": "82f31cbac81ae066b2444a3d9b5bf2f14c8bca93410ffd2d50c0151d15205dcd", "ja": "うん。のり子、律子、さんみたい。\nスタイルいーんだし、もっと自信持てばいいのに。", "zh": "嗯。法子跟律子……前辈好像哦。\n身材明明那么好，要是更有自信一点就好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_151_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_151_1030_043nor", "source_sha256": "cc3d1b0c27b19eb2e136a5454549d5498ed2afcb10bdf3c4553e1f3a71a08812", "ja": "そんなこと言われたって、\nそう簡単に自信なんて持てないよ～！", "zh": "就算你这么说，也没那么容易就能有自信啊～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_151_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_151_1031_p", "source_sha256": "49c83c83788543d8bf7e6f5f27500380d8b1bcb83d4f86750f61b32c2fb6e78f", "ja": "まぁまぁ。ひとまず、のり子の気持ちはわかったよ。\nもう一回聞くけど、出演自体は嫌ではないんだよな？", "zh": "好啦好啦。总之，我明白你的心情了。\n我再确认一次，你并不讨厌出演本身，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_151_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_151_1032_043nor", "source_sha256": "e9806fee1465931dd413a53f922ac1528dd311cae98375c3fde6f9b213cd308d", "ja": "う、うん！　アイドルとしては、\nすごいチャンスだもん。挑戦するよ！", "zh": "嗯、嗯！作为偶像来说，\n这可是一个绝佳的机会啊。我要挑战看看！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_151_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_151_1033_p", "source_sha256": "134ff4348b0da5db8644e8f27107bc549357272e34773e1e1b43dee06d963543", "ja": "じゃあそれについては、後で話そう。\nとりあえず、ミーティングに入っても大丈夫か？", "zh": "那关于这件事，我们之后再谈吧。总之，现在开始开会可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_151_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_151_1034_p", "source_sha256": "aef3c787a5ff3002fa909a38c78ab3634787ea7637b8e491cd7c0e8bcb87ef6b", "ja": "ファッションショーの後に、ライブもあるからな。\nなるべくレッスンにも時間を割きたいし……。", "zh": "时装秀之后还有演唱会。\n所以也想尽量抽出时间来训练……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_151_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_151_1035_043nor", "source_sha256": "59f3c02ed2e84daa93869320d12a3b3e76c02b717da8b2993b17c6ca8543816b", "ja": "そ、そうだよね。みんなごめん、時間取っちゃって！\n気を取り直して、ミーティング始めよっか！", "zh": "对、对啊。抱歉，占用了大家的时间！\n重新振作起来，开始开会吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_151_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_151_1036_p", "source_sha256": "67e3dc85c10be687895c1b3f59d3d26e4ae3cb3a9df9f042646623e0954919e8", "ja": "（さて、そろそろレッスンが終わったころかな。\nさっきの件、のり子と話をしないと……）", "zh": "（那么，差不多该下课了吧。\n得和纪子谈谈刚才那件事……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_151_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_151_1037_se", "source_sha256": "3acc3d8d20a36f0a3257a2150ed2ff29259cbfec1d7baf7c3ef5ae9411f0f515", "ja": "バタバタバタ……", "zh": "噔噔噔……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_151_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_151_1038_p", "source_sha256": "3e7925245f3497c8053c09d798509cab823d5ce606d1e9daf340839cff59a87a", "ja": "ん？　この足音は……。", "zh": "嗯？这脚步声是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_151_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_151_1039_se", "source_sha256": "e2b679ed49b66f508294c1f48413d86b36bfd7fe992fd364ab6317491c4fef73", "ja": "バタン！", "zh": "砰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_151_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_151_1040_043nor", "source_sha256": "d5243f15328691381b924d24fd9de43052a98f041ff8d968824d01cd8a9f5039", "ja": "{$P$}！　って、わあっ！", "zh": "{$P$}！　哎呀，哇啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_151_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_151_1041_p", "source_sha256": "f9bf7a73b3b4ed1a337b828f689ca0694825a7e3c199b78ea293e2a160e5f35b", "ja": "うぼあっ！？", "zh": "呜喔啊！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_151_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_151_1042_043nor", "source_sha256": "e27d8b37d17f663f91d19253ceff3111126a4c5f3a084b28db3c2f3ed6372cd2", "ja": "ああっ、ごめん、{$P$}！\nそんなとこにいるなんて思わなくて……！", "zh": "啊，对不起，{$P$}！\n没想到你会在那里……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_151_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_151_1043_p", "source_sha256": "8347032461d22e7546bb052843ac8d22757ee32cb04b28ee3c31957c1269ff8c", "ja": "（のり子の声だけが聞こえる……\nなんかこの状況、前にもどこかで……）", "zh": "（只能听到典子的声音……这种情况，总觉得以前在哪里也遇到过……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_151_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_151_1044_043nor", "source_sha256": "c341821fcb8676a52a593c7ea57cdb3a35b8f45c30e11015e78223f893c2cac5", "ja": "え！？　どうしよう、気絶しちゃった！？　\nちょ、ちょっと～{$P$}！！", "zh": "诶！？怎么办，晕过去了！？  \n等、等一下～{$P$}！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_151_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_151_1045_p", "source_sha256": "0499e6981ccb356781b094b5e7ea25f98ec1ed97128f9c0f6a9b816f96a01e42", "ja": "（ああ、のり子が心配してる……。\n大丈夫だ、気絶してないって言わないと……）", "zh": "（啊，典子在担心我……\n得告诉她我没晕过去才行……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_151_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_151_1047_p", "source_sha256": "81aa2fefbeb42209f0455d06966ba5cac2dbb53c67f899f60653355a1f65e65d", "ja": "うーん……はっ！　俺はいったい……？", "zh": "嗯……哈！我到底……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_151_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_151_1048_043nor", "source_sha256": "1953cb1d48fd3611205500996d868df02dfd3d338af3744b51581f704b6b4b4b", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}！？\n気がついた！？　よかったぁ……。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}！？\n你醒啦！？太好了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_151_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_151_1049_043nor", "source_sha256": "3850dd3b1f7ae3fbfa66fe319e1f9697e38b639d3cb06580d00d94ce91b0d7d6", "ja": "ごめんね、アタシがノックしなかったから。\n勢いあまって、全力スピアー決まっちゃった……。", "zh": "对不起，因为我没敲门。\n一不小心就使出了全力飞冲……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_151_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_151_1050_p", "source_sha256": "78411e4456717450aeb82604b8d419ca972167295007b7149d519cb0d8b83f08", "ja": "いや、大丈夫だよ。\nなんだかよく眠っていたような気もするし……。", "zh": "没事，没关系。\n感觉好像睡得挺香的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_151_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_151_1051_p", "source_sha256": "361d264da5524f20a35fa995af8a09d5179e2d80488155e65139dd59c04089e7", "ja": "それに、ちょっと懐かしいなって。\nのり子とは、前にもこんなことあったよな。", "zh": "而且，总觉得有点怀念。\n我和纪子以前也发生过这样的事吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_151_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_151_1052_043nor", "source_sha256": "cd4ec1aaa73e471a77a0bd3e5e49e2c5154232700335e3c3fc010dbe570f6d44", "ja": "うっ……それって、{$P$}と\n初めて会った時のことだよね？", "zh": "唔……那是指和{$P$}\n第一次见面时的事吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_151_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_151_1053_p", "source_sha256": "1308fbcb0c1a9c88abbdcc34200c92fa45373bb7c2076eb02969226ba0cff71e", "ja": "そうそう、すごく元気な子がいるなと思って、\nそれでスカウトしたんだよな。", "zh": "对对，我当时觉得有个特别有活力的孩子，就把她招募过来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_151_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_151_1054_043nor", "source_sha256": "41515d1704074e6fc6ff15d882f00b0c6640753a32a1b817944c2f117e3c97f1", "ja": "元気……う、うん、そうだったね！", "zh": "有精神……嗯、嗯，是这么回事！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_151_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_151_1055_p", "source_sha256": "143fe98d6d4b69c6ff7bcb1da30b1f38a4e12b162180a6943052fa5553055bc3", "ja": "あの時、のり子をスカウトしてよかったよ。\n俺の目に間違いはなかった。", "zh": "那时候能把你挖掘过来真是太好了，法子。\n我的眼光果然没有错。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_151_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_151_1056_043nor", "source_sha256": "734f28f2852e3060cb25ae75d97ac7d494bd6a6e59be600ac7b4c66dbe43bead", "ja": "{$P$}……それ、本当？", "zh": "{$P$}……那是真的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_151_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_151_1057_p", "source_sha256": "cfc8ee90aa7c29ccf125c280faf34e87b6674a4cc45230240b1fa77b1a0ba0aa", "ja": "ああ。だってのり子は、ここまでちゃんと\nアイドルやってこられたじゃないか。", "zh": "啊。因为你不是已经好好地当偶像走到今天了吗。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_151_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_151_1058_p", "source_sha256": "23464aee961c700b9a065e356917df118f379b2432088a8cd770fde5ad06a6ab", "ja": "現に今、応援してくれるファンがいて。\nJCCみたいな、新しい大きな仕事も任されてる。", "zh": "事实上，现在也有支持你的粉丝。\n还接到了像JCC这样全新的重要工作。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_151_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_151_1059_p", "source_sha256": "bfed9d6c6b9d4c20a99ab19b59e786183add666b405ea27939dc981c8c34b1ef", "ja": "それは、デビューできたからって、\nどんなアイドルにもできることじゃないよ。", "zh": "那可不是每个偶像都能做到的，并不是成功出道了就可以。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_151_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_151_1060_043nor", "source_sha256": "bd19161a245b5bf7b74279fae432dbbe527da7deb9d1e0ba7a0c71daa00ca4ed", "ja": "……うん。", "zh": "……嗯。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_151_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_151_1061_p", "source_sha256": "3f9b83df41abe348d00aa61a3ac96a4047bd2066bf14aa04d9499583044557ea", "ja": "だから、次のステージだって大丈夫だよ。\nいつも通りののり子で、お客さんを魅了しよう！", "zh": "所以，下一场演出也没问题。\n像平时一样展现出你的活力，去俘获观众的心吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_151_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_151_1062_043nor", "source_sha256": "6e33d24f62e477b9ad878795ed0f01eca307e1222d14d258b17716e51bdb1959", "ja": "ん……。ありがと、{$P$}。\nえへへ。ちょっとだけ、元気でたかも……。", "zh": "嗯……谢谢你，{$P$}。\n嘿嘿。感觉稍微打起一点精神来了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
